        dct:description "Deterministic (seed 1917, no stochastic step), --self-test (<1 s) and full run (~4 s) documented in the docstring, outputs written to fixed paths, every input digest verified. Deductions: per-specimen processing annotations (ROI, deskew, k_sigma) live in the reference JSON and were tuned by the builder; dependency versions are not pinned in the script; no CLI switch to vary thresholds." ;
